# Altitude Market (CIPlay altitude_market): a sky island 35 m up; the rim, the crier's board, the station (vines), the
# clock tower (screechers, keypad 3517), the fireworks stall, the rigger's chest, the zipline down to the lower terrace
# (step 9: the plan's done-when) and the ballast release (signal ballast: it brings Sinkmarket Floor). Vending machine.
island Altitude Market
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Market Day in the Sky
zone market_rim
expect step 1
read Market crier's board
expect step 2
open Porter's toolbox
wait 3
expect item Machete 1
use stationvines
expect hidden stationvines
zone station
expect step 3
open Station office
wait 3
expect step 5
zone clocktower
kill Screecher
expect step 6
code clockpad 3517
open Clock tower room
wait 3
expect step 7
open Fireworks stall
wait 3
expect step 8
open Rigger's chest
wait 3
expect step 9
zone lower_terrace
expect step 10
use release
expect story ballastdrop 1
expect done
